%7C25057868a5e24098f11308dcfea1f908%7Cfbef079820e34be7bdc8372032610f65%7C1%=
7C0%7C638665218837357849%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIl=
YiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7=
C%7C&sdata=3DcLlfVEU7AMnU6gsnZ1A3ogFxXwE1A7ZDVt3FTrQ4XIA%3D&reserved=3D0> t=
oday informing the research community of grant increases that will be imple=
mented as a result of new funding announced in the 2024 Federal Budget<http=
s://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fbudget.cana=
da.ca%2F2024%2Fhome-accueil-en.html&data=3D05%7C02%7CRESGRANT%40NSERC-CRSNG=
.GC.CA%7C25057868a5e24098f11308dcfea1f908%7Cfbef079820e34be7bdc8372032610f6=
5%7C1%7C0%7C638665218837381325%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRy=
dWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C=
0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=3DeBsvbwJrGYJj12RaddYm3BFW2c6YO%2FiCmBDC%2FZIGtCY%3D&reser=
ved=3D0>.



This message is to inform you that we will be contacting Research Grants Of=
fices in the coming weeks with additional details, as soon as there is fina=
l confirmation on increase amounts and timeline for payment in this fiscal =
year. In the meantime, if you receive questions from researchers at your in=
stitution, please advise them to await this further information.



We thank you for your patience and wish you all the best during this busy s=
eason.



Program Planning and Operations

Research Grants and Scholarships

Natural Sciences and Engineering Research Council of Canada



  _____



Le CRSNG a annonc=E9<https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=3D=
https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nserc-crsng.gc.ca%2FMedia-Media%2FNewsDetail-DetailNouvel=
les_fra.asp%3FID%3D1495&data=3D05%7C02%7CRESGRANT%40NSERC-CRSNG.GC.CA%7C250=
57868a5e24098f11308dcfea1f908%7Cfbef079820e34be7bdc8372032610f65%7C1%7C0%7C=
638665218837398133%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIw=
LjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&s=
data=3DbxCoJuf%2FpFcqgJf1AAE0Y7KD%2F1t1Ib2aLKlWAIWezT8%3D&reserved=3D0> auj=
ourd=92hui l=92augmentation de certaines subventions de recherche par suite=
 des mesures annonc=E9es dans le budget f=E9d=E9ral de 2024<https://can01.s=
afelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fbudget.canada.ca%2F202=
4%2Fhome-accueil-fr.html&data=3D05%7C02%7CRESGRANT%40NSERC-CRSNG.GC.CA%7C25=
057868a5e24098f11308dcfea1f908%7Cfbef079820e34be7bdc8372032610f65%7C1%7C0%7=
C638665218837414586%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiI=
wLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&=
sdata=3DXa0K6lBYosyJamWWZwmIXKdX63AePA4B3ymXZRgKbVs%3D&reserved=3D0>.



Ce message a pour but de vous informer que nous contacterons les bureaux de=
s subventions de recherche dans les semaines =E0 venir afin de fournir des =
d=E9tails suppl=E9mentaires d=E8s qu'il y aura une confirmation finale de l=
a valeur des augmentations et du calendrier de paiement pour cette ann=E9e =
financi=E8re. Entre-temps, si vous recevez des questions de chercheuses ou =
chercheurs de votre =E9tablissement, veuillez leur conseiller d'attendre ce=
s d=E9tails.



Nous vous remercions de votre patience et vous souhaitons tout le meilleur =
durant cette p=E9riode occup=E9e.



Planification des programmes et des op=E9rations

Direction des subventions de recherche et bourses

Conseil de recherches en sciences naturelles et en g=E9nie du Canada




